---
import { getProjects } from '../lib/projects';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import TShape from '../components/TShape.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
const latest = (await getProjects()).slice(0, 3);
---
<Base title="Home">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Operations research,<br />grounded in <em>real data.</em></h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Deep in mathematical optimization, broad across data analysis, machine learning and engineering.
      Case studies connect optimization, data validation and working prototypes, with assumptions and limits made explicit.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="activity-link" aria-labelledby="activity-title">
    <h2 id="activity-title">활동과 프로젝트 전체 기록</h2>
    <p>최적화·에너지, 제조·환경 분석, 교통 데이터, AI 제품과 자동화까지. 활동별 상세 페이지에서 배경과 구현, 실험 결과와 판단을 읽을 수 있습니다.</p>
    <a href={url('/activities/')}>상세 활동 기록 읽기 →</a>
  </section>
  <h2 class="section-title">Deep in one thing.<br />Broad around it.</h2>
  <TShape />
  <h2 class="section-title sm">Latest projects</h2>
  {latest.length === 0 ? <p class="muted">Coming soon.</p> : (
    <ul class="plain">
      {latest.map((p) => (
        <li class="card"><a href={url(`/projects/${p.id}/`)}>{p.data.title}</a>
          <span class="muted"> · {p.data.domain}</span></li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  )}
  <p><a href={url('/projects/')}>All projects →</a></p>
</Base>
